#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:5 3e3035be6635447cb054bd6a3dbf4d05
msgid "ROS 2 Interfaces"
msgstr "ROS 2 接口"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:7 930a677e63f44212b6e448cd05b7575d
msgid ""
"The purpose of this page is to document all the ROS 2 interfaces available "
"in ArduPilot. Content is organized by functional area the data is used."
msgstr "本页旨在记录 ArduPilot 中所有可用的 ROS 2 接口，内容按数据使用的功能领域进行组织。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:11 b18b8e3f293b4ae09ace99b36872161d
msgid "Sensors"
msgstr "传感器"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:13 83bb133b708e465eaa8765aade620da1
msgid ""
"ArduPilot exposes \"sensor\" type data over DDS, that usually corresponds to"
" a physical component, or some filtered version of it."
msgstr "ArduPilot 通过 DDS 公开「传感器」类型的数据，这些数据通常对应于物理组件或其经过滤波处理后的版本。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:51 b6bab266a2c14af0a93f5117f04320ef
msgid "Pose, Rates, and Coordinates"
msgstr "姿态、角速度与坐标"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:92 a91d2aff5c244e9aada6c1e4caebc3c2
msgid "Time"
msgstr "时间"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:117 ad70d3fd259342f9b09c93a151c04f3b
msgid "Control"
msgstr "控制"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:119 2f1237f19017479d8772b78b4457a37a
msgid ""
"The control interfaces are how a companion computer can command the "
"autopilot to move either it's control surfaces, motors, or tell the "
"autopilot to control to a setpoint position, velocity, acceleration. Control"
" includes the high level navigation objectives."
msgstr "控制接口是伴飞计算机向飞控发出指令的方式，可控制舵面、电机，或要求飞控跟踪目标位置、速度、加速度。控制还包含高层导航目标。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:155 a882ebefa83c42999e9d1406c71bd024
msgid ""
"For more information on the high level goal interface, see the "
":ref:`Waypoint Goal Interface<ros2-waypoint-goal-interface>`"
msgstr "关于高层目标接口的更多信息，请参阅 :ref:`航点目标接口<ros2-waypoint-goal-interface>`"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:159 a7d70ba5f1204fb9b6aece809080afba
msgid "Commands"
msgstr "命令"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:161 660cca5c9aa54bda9072ba60a4a56da6
msgid "ArduPilot exposes service servers for the following purposes:"
msgstr "ArduPilot 为以下用途提供服务服务器："

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:163 51121e7817b14d6ab6a0c62eb7b51a31
msgid "Pre-arm check"
msgstr "解锁前检查"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:164 50e7609ea31c4cd8b7cef3f5aab86bbc
msgid "Arming"
msgstr "解锁"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:165 a51aaf87d7a441409735347f660246fa
msgid "Changing modes"
msgstr "切换飞行模式"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:166 739c392f5c8e4ad19427fdd320f63a03
msgid "Takeoff (copter only)"
msgstr "起飞（仅多旋翼）"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:169 52c29883aa314c4a89a43acfaf8b20cf
msgid "Odometry"
msgstr "里程计"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:171 49759a4a06d740c09c7f77e000db5211
msgid ""
"Ardupilot may not have a good estimate of where it is relative to where it "
"started moving. A companion computer can interface with sensors that provide"
" odometry, which is the computation of the dynamic transform from the "
"``odom`` frame to the ``base_link`` frame. This data is fed into ArduPilot's"
" ``AP_VisualOdom`` library. This data may come from visual sensors, however "
"other technologies such as radar and lidar can also provide odometry data. "
"Regardless of the method of odometry, ArduPilot has a single ROS interface "
"to receive it."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 可能无法准确估计其相对于起始位置的当前位置。伴飞计算机可与提供里程计数据的传感器交互，里程计是从 ``odom`` 坐标系到 "
"``base_link`` 坐标系的动态变换计算。这些数据会输入到 ArduPilot 的 ``AP_VisualOdom`` "
"库中。数据可来自视觉传感器，也可来自雷达、激光雷达等其他技术。无论使用哪种里程计方法，ArduPilot 均通过统一的 ROS 接口接收数据。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:178 1c2032eaad114d58945522251e32e0c6
msgid ""
"This data typically comes from a `TF2 Transfrom Tree "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Intermediate/Tf2/Tf2-Main.html>`_."
" For more information on the coordinate systems used, review `ROS REP-105 "
"<https://www.ros.org/reps/rep-0105.html>`_."
msgstr ""
"这些数据通常来自 `TF2 变换树 "
"<https://docs.ros.org/en/humble/Tutorials/Intermediate/Tf2/Tf2-Main.html>`_。关于所用坐标系的更多信息，请参阅"
" `ROS REP-105 <https://www.ros.org/reps/rep-0105.html>`_。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:200 0aa6b7d98ae94c7791658cc19be00e74
msgid ""
"Only the dynamic transformations on ``/ap/tf`` that have parent_frame "
"``odom`` and child_frame ``base_link`` are fed into ``AP_VisualOdom``. Other"
" frame configurations will be gracefully ignored, so feel free to populate "
"this topic with other transforms if that's convenient."
msgstr ""
"只有 ``/ap/tf`` 上父坐标系为 ``odom``、子坐标系为 ``base_link`` 的动态变换才会输入到 "
"``AP_VisualOdom``。其他坐标系配置将被忽略，可以根据需要在此话题中发布其他变换。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:203 58c5c9aec6f84a94adbbdd857ca8969e
msgid ""
"For more information on how to setup ArduPilot with an external odometry "
"source, see the :ref:`cartographer SLAM example<ros2-cartographer-slam>`."
msgstr ""
"关于如何将 ArduPilot 配置为使用外部里程计数据源，请参阅 :ref:`Cartographer SLAM "
"示例<ros2-cartographer-slam>`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:206 82e7414038254f42a523014da2c02911
msgid "Configuring Interfaces at Compile Time"
msgstr "编译时配置接口"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:208 1441416416844c50b0e21fa3c38a393a
msgid ""
"ArduPilot strives to only consume the resources it needs. The DDS interface "
"is no exception."
msgstr "ArduPilot 致力于只使用必要的资源，DDS 接口也不例外。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:211 0e4ccffb0cbe433788c6d25358a0150f
msgid ""
"Every topic and service can be individually enabled or disabled at compile "
"time. See :ref:`common-oem-customizations`."
msgstr "每个话题和服务均可在编译时单独启用或禁用。请参阅 :ref:`common-oem-customizations`。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:215 6acb92c8f6044d37abf385aacc39456c
msgid ""
"Refer to the `AP_DDS_Config.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_DDS/AP_DDS_config.h>`_"
" file on what is exposed."
msgstr ""
"请参阅 `AP_DDS_Config.h "
"<https://github.com/ArduPilot/ardupilot/blob/master/libraries/AP_DDS/AP_DDS_config.h>`_"
" 文件了解所公开的接口。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:218 f13ad6e1df5b46198d5ea271d6b0e7d4
msgid ""
"Additionally, publish rates form ArduPilot also all indivually configurable "
"at compile time."
msgstr "此外，ArduPilot 的发布频率也均可在编译时单独配置。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:220 9c900db38aba43b787e7a0fe48ee02ca
msgid ""
"When deploying ArduPilot on a resource constrained autopilot, developers can"
" disable interfaces they do not use and tune data rates to only what their "
"applications need."
msgstr "在资源受限的飞控上部署 ArduPilot 时，开发者可以禁用不使用的接口，并将数据速率调整为应用所需的最低限度。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:225 5e963e414d984e79a3739abdec8cb8c6
msgid "Adding New Interfaces"
msgstr "添加新接口"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:227 2b069df534684228b480729aa98e3281
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's DDS interface is designed to be extensible. Interfaces for "
"pub/sub and services are easily added."
msgstr "ArduPilot 的 DDS 接口设计具有可扩展性，发布/订阅接口和服务接口均可方便地添加。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:230 668aa24de4a4431d93e9806f4cdefd4d
msgid ""
"If the interfaces are generic, consider contributing them to ArduPilot. "
"Custom application-specific interfaces are also easy to add and maintain on "
"private forks of ArduPilot."
msgstr ""
"如果接口具有通用性，请考虑将其贡献给 ArduPilot。特定应用的自定义接口也可以在 ArduPilot 的私有 fork 中方便地添加和维护。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:234 dde3bdaa6deb466e8675bd8a78b416f6
msgid ""
"Interfaces that use custom messages that aren't already used commonly in the"
" ROS 2 ecosystem are typically added with an ``experimental`` designator."
msgstr "使用 ROS 2 生态系统中尚未普遍应用的自定义消息的接口，通常会带有 ``experimental`` （实验性）标识。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:239 9ef1b3c77fe34ab58894247164f8eea7
msgid "ABI Stability Guarantees"
msgstr "ABI 稳定性保证"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:241 d549d5897640447792772eb1409e417a
msgid ""
"ArduPilot's DDS interface is intended to be ABI stable within an ArduPilot "
"minor release. Common interfaces such as ``NavSatFix`` are unlikely to "
"change, however experimental interfaces such as ``IMU`` may change, and are "
"denoted with the ``experimental`` topic prefix. In extenuating "
"circumstances, non-experimental topics may require bugfixes that change "
"behavior, however message definitions will be kept compatible."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 的 DDS 接口在同一次要版本内保证 ABI 稳定。``NavSatFix`` 等通用接口不大可能改变，但 ``IMU`` "
"等实验性接口可能会变化，以 ``experimental`` 话题前缀标识。在特殊情况下，非实验性话题可能需要修复 bug "
"而改变行为，但消息定义将保持兼容。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:247 c100b519283440ef9cb9f3a7bd355cbe
msgid ""
"Because the ROS way of updating messages is to not change messages within a "
"ROS release, many tools do not cope well with messages. Different versions "
"of the message between an autopilot and companion computer can lead to "
"receiving junk data without any errors, or cryptic serialization errors. "
"Thus, ArduPilot will do it's best to avoid changing messages. If breaking "
"changes are required, the ArduPilot release notes will make that clear."
msgstr ""
"由于 ROS "
"的惯例是在同一版本内不修改消息，许多工具对消息不兼容处理较差。飞控与伴飞计算机之间消息版本不一致可能导致无任何报错地收到垃圾数据，或出现难以理解的序列化错误。因此，ArduPilot"
" 将尽量避免修改消息。若必须进行不兼容修改，ArduPilot 的发行说明将明确指出。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:254 1104876fdf42495486ac3f41465e72fc
msgid ""
"Developers should not expect ABI stability on ``exerimental`` interfaces."
msgstr "开发者不应期望 ``exerimental`` （实验性）接口具有 ABI 稳定性。"

#: ../../source/docs/ros2-interfaces.rst:256 55d9932fb4a34b099747ee6d9adc654a
msgid ""
"Because ArduPilot does not follow the same release timeline as ROS 2, and "
"the development team for the ROS interface is still in its early stages, "
"ArduPilot does not yet support a stable ABI across multiple ROS "
"distributions. The current ROS version supported is ``humble``."
msgstr ""
"由于 ArduPilot 的发布时间表与 ROS 2 不一致，且 ROS 接口开发团队仍处于早期阶段，ArduPilot 目前尚不支持跨多个 ROS "
"发行版的稳定 ABI。当前支持的 ROS 版本为 ``humble``。"
